## JWT 인증 시스템

### Access Token + Refresh Token 흐름

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server
    participant DB as Redis

    C->>S: POST /auth/login (credentials)
    S->>S: 인증 검증
    S->>DB: Refresh Token 저장
    S-->>C: Access Token (15분) + Refresh Token (7일)

    Note over C,S: Access Token 만료 후

    C->>S: POST /auth/refresh (Refresh Token)
    S->>DB: Refresh Token 검증
    S->>DB: 기존 Refresh Token 삭제 (로테이션)
    S->>DB: 새 Refresh Token 저장
    S-->>C: 새 Access Token + 새 Refresh Token
```

### JWT 토큰 생성/검증

```kotlin
@Component
class JwtTokenProvider(
    @Value("\${jwt.secret}") private val secret: String,
    @Value("\${jwt.access-expiration}") private val accessExpiration: Long,
    @Value("\${jwt.refresh-expiration}") private val refreshExpiration: Long
) {
    private val key: SecretKey by lazy {
        Keys.hmacShaKeyFor(secret.toByteArray())
    }

    fun createAccessToken(userId: Long, roles: List<String>): String {
        return Jwts.builder()
            .subject(userId.toString())
            .claim("roles", roles)
            .issuedAt(Date())
            .expiration(Date(System.currentTimeMillis() + accessExpiration))
            .signWith(key)
            .compact()
    }

    fun validateToken(token: String): Claims {
        return try {
            Jwts.parser()
                .verifyWith(key)
                .build()
                .parseSignedClaims(token)
                .payload
        } catch (e: ExpiredJwtException) {
            throw TokenExpiredException("토큰이 만료되었습니다")
        } catch (e: JwtException) {
            throw InvalidTokenException("유효하지 않은 토큰입니다")
        }
    }
}
```

### Refresh Token 로테이션

```kotlin
@Service
class AuthService(
    private val tokenProvider: JwtTokenProvider,
    private val refreshTokenRepository: RefreshTokenRepository  // Redis
) {
    fun refresh(refreshToken: String): TokenPair {
        // 1. Refresh Token 검증
        val claims = tokenProvider.validateToken(refreshToken)
        val userId = claims.subject.toLong()

        // 2. 저장된 토큰과 비교 (탈취 감지)
        val stored = refreshTokenRepository.findByUserId(userId)
            ?: throw InvalidTokenException("로그아웃된 사용자입니다")

        if (stored.token != refreshToken) {
            // 탈취 의심! 해당 사용자의 모든 Refresh Token 무효화
            refreshTokenRepository.deleteAllByUserId(userId)
            throw TokenTheftException("토큰 탈취가 감지되었습니다")
        }

        // 3. 로테이션: 기존 삭제 + 새로 발급
        refreshTokenRepository.delete(stored)
        val newAccessToken = tokenProvider.createAccessToken(userId, claims["roles"] as List<String>)
        val newRefreshToken = tokenProvider.createRefreshToken(userId)
        refreshTokenRepository.save(RefreshTokenEntity(userId, newRefreshToken))

        return TokenPair(newAccessToken, newRefreshToken)
    }
}
```

